      <p begin="00:15.980" end="00:18.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Wait a minute (Uh), get it how you live it (Uh)</p>
      <p begin="00:18.460" end="00:20.930" ttm:agent="v1">Ten toes in when we standin' on business</p>
      <p begin="00:20.930" end="00:23.670" ttm:agent="v1">I'm a big stepper, underground methods</p>
      <p begin="00:23.670" end="00:26.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Top notch hoes get the most, not the lesser (Most, not the lesser)</p>
