      <p begin="00:28.990" end="00:31.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Pushing culture baby, got that product you can't measure (Product you can't measure)</p>
      <p begin="00:31.750" end="00:34.300" ttm:agent="v1">Trend setter, the one who gets hеr wetter</p>
