      <p begin="00:43.940" end="00:46.550" ttm:agent="v1">That's how you make the money pile for everyone involved</p>
      <p begin="00:46.550" end="00:49.330" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">But if you don't deserve a cut then we gon' cut them off (Cut them off)</p>
