      <p begin="00:51.930" end="00:54.630" ttm:agent="v1">Fresh fade getting faded on that top grade</p>
      <p begin="00:54.630" end="00:57.480" ttm:agent="v1">You ain't walkin' out alive smoking what we on</p>
      <p begin="00:57.480" end="01:00.090" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And you know I gotta pour it for the ones who gone (Gone)</p>
