      <p begin="01:07.940" end="01:10.530" ttm:agent="v1">That's how we knowing that the flow about to carry on</p>
      <p begin="01:10.530" end="01:13.330" ttm:agent="v1">See immortality's a fallacy, I prove 'em wrong</p>
