      <p begin="01:59.750" end="02:02.620" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Only thing I'm breaking is her back with the motions (Whoo)</p>
      <p begin="02:02.620" end="02:05.490" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, baby girl bring out the goodies</p>
      <p begin="02:05.490" end="02:07.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Snuck it in inside her hoodie, now we turnin' up to boogie (Yeah)</p>
